From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP keep queued joins alive and off the cut

A join that has a UUID but no play listener was sitting silent, so
ReadTimeoutHandler kicked it at 30s. Do not refuse the login slot, and
do not hand the connection to a region until the play listener is
installed. A cut column is not a spawn: the search already returns null,
and a position already chosen for that column steps to the next section
so the spawn task can finish. Not a longer timeout.
Post-applyAllPatches.
